# FIN-002: MedSync Health Annual Report 2023

**Date:** January 17, 2024
**Currency:** United Arab Emirates Dirham (AED)

---

## Letter from the CEO

To Our Shareholders, Employees, and Partners,

The year 2023 was a landmark period of accelerated growth and strategic expansion for MedSync Health. We successfully navigated a dynamic healthcare technology landscape, solidifying our position as a leader in digital health platforms. Our commitment to seamless integration and data-driven insights has driven significant value for our customers—hospitals, clinics, and insurance providers—and, most importantly, for the patients they serve.

Our Annual Recurring Revenue (ARR) grew by **47.1%** to reach **AED 367.5 million** in 2023, up from AED 249.9 million in 2022. This growth is a direct result of the successful adoption of our core product suite and the strategic integrations we completed, including the critical connections with major Electronic Health Record (EHR) systems, Epic and Cerner, in January and April 2023, respectively. Our team expanded to **1,100 dedicated professionals** by the end of the year, a testament to our investment in talent and culture.

Looking ahead, we are focused on leveraging the momentum from our Series C funding round in late 2022 to invest heavily in R&D, particularly in AI-driven predictive analytics. We remain committed to our mission of synchronizing healthcare for a healthier world.

Sincerely,

Dr. Sarah Chen
Chief Executive Officer, MedSync Health

